1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:08,058
Maya's class all tap play at once.

3
00:00:08,058 --> 00:00:10,106
Twenty games!

4
00:00:10,106 --> 00:00:12,632
One Eddie cannot do it.

5
00:00:12,632 --> 00:00:14,587
He wobbles.

6
00:00:14,587 --> 00:00:16,422
Toys drop.

7
00:00:16,422 --> 00:00:18,630
Boxy opens!

8
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:22,327
Little Eddies pop out and run the jobs.

9
00:00:22,327 --> 00:00:25,026
Boxy is E C S.

10
00:00:25,026 --> 00:00:28,523
A toy box that runs many Eddies.

11
00:00:28,523 --> 00:00:29,973
Tweet!

12
00:00:29,973 --> 00:00:32,566
Kira blows her whistle.

13
00:00:32,566 --> 00:00:35,836
Five Boxys line up in a row.

14
00:00:35,836 --> 00:00:38,603
Kira is E K S.

15
00:00:38,603 --> 00:00:41,688
The captain of the toy boxes.

16
00:00:41,688 --> 00:00:43,164
Whoosh!

17
00:00:43,164 --> 00:00:46,448
Fay flies a box up to a house.

18
00:00:46,448 --> 00:00:48,696
No Eddie under it!

19
00:00:48,696 --> 00:00:50,996
Fay is Fargate.

20
00:00:50,996 --> 00:00:52,872
She flies.

21
00:00:52,872 --> 00:00:55,984
No Eddie has to hold the box.

22
00:00:55,984 --> 00:00:58,058
The games load.

23
00:00:58,058 --> 00:00:59,893
All twenty!

24
00:00:59,893 --> 00:01:01,914
Maya cheers.

25
00:01:01,914 --> 00:01:05,000
Now you know the toy boxes!

26
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,694
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

